    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Based on True Crime</h2>The Hinterkaifeck farm Murders persisted of 6 members of the Gruber family being killed in a disturbing way with unexplainable events that follow it all throughout<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Built with terrifying detail for horror lovers</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905230/extras/1f3645b33f3a1602cb385c1529c7fe47.poster.avif?t=1658827149\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905230/extras/1f3645b33f3a1602cb385c1529c7fe47.webm?t=1658827149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905230/extras/1f3645b33f3a1602cb385c1529c7fe47.mp4?t=1658827149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Play as the Head of the family (Andreas Gruber) and experience the events unfold (with enhanced elements to the story) <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905230/extras/afb73f4fd02f97aea95e40949103de9e.poster.avif?t=1658827149\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905230/extras/afb73f4fd02f97aea95e40949103de9e.webm?t=1658827149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1905230/extras/afb73f4fd02f97aea95e40949103de9e.mp4?t=1658827149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Your decisions impact the flow of the game and your experience with a focus on Good and Bad and where they lead you in life.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Warning</h2>this game is not for people with heart problems, phobias of blood or people under the age of 18<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features And Mechanics:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Retro 90's aesthetic<br></li><li>NPC Dialogue <br></li><li>Multiple Choice Situations<br></li><li>Snowy Environment <br></li><li>Usable Vintage Camera<br></li><li>Bear AI<br></li><li>Challenging Situations under pressure</li></ul> <br>Hinter; a scare in the winter<br><br>Early look; images are subject to change",
